    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "3 rd  floor, 1double bedroom apartment located in Linden Court, Blackrock/ Stillorgan The property consists of a bright spacious living room with two sofas, kitchen, bathroom along with a double bedroom . The kitchen is fitted with appliances including large fridge/freezer, oven, electric hob, washer/dryer, dishwasher, microwave and kettle. Wooden floors throughout. Bathroom fitted with  shower / bath unit. Designated electronic gated  parking space included  and Large gardens on the complex.\r\n\r\nIn one of Dublin's most convenient locations the property is a short walk to both Stillorgan Shopping Centre as well as Blackrock Village and its many amenities . Well serviced by public transport, bus and Dart\r\n\r\nIncludes service charges, refuse (bins), caretaker, property tax and designated underground gated parking space. \r\nPlus €1000 tax back credit per year per tenant registered.\r\n\r\nReply to maypoleproperty@gmail.com. You can see this and other properties on our Facebook page maypole property."
      },
